        "Description": "A contract has been issued, and you have been cleared to engage. \r\rMake sure you bring the fiber wire and an explosive device, ducks are allowed.\r\rKill Haru with an ICA approved explosive, no propane tanks; we want the ICA trademarked shrapnel to be discovered in this guy.\r\rYou can deal with Max and Bunka as you please but use the wire to finish\rMakio and Katashi.",
